---
Create effect_free() function to properly release heap-allocated effect buffers.

Currently effect_init() memsets the slot to zero, destroying heap pointers for
delay buffers and reverb comb/allpass arrays. This leaks memory every time an
effect type is changed or a project is loaded.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] effect_free() function that frees delay.buffer, reverb.combs, reverb.allpasses
- [ ] effect_init() calls effect_free() before memset
- [ ] mixer_view type change calls effect_free() before reinit
- [ ] project_load frees existing effects before loading new ones
- [ ] sq_engine_shutdown() walks all effect slots and frees them

## Test Plan
- [ ] Unit test: init delay, free, verify no leak (valgrind/ASan)
- [ ] Unit test: init reverb, change to delay, verify old reverb freed
- [ ] Integration: load project twice, verify no memory growth
